sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Usuario en Voz
    participant Discord as Discord Gateway / API
    participant Hoshiko as Hoshiko Music (Bot)
    participant Lavalink as Lavalink v4
    participant DiscordVoice as Discord Voice Server
    participant Provider as Proveedor de Audio

    User->>Discord: Ejecuta /play (canción o enlace)
    Discord->>Hoshiko: interactionCreate (ChatInputCommand)
    Hoshiko->>Discord: deferReply() (Asegura ventana de 3s)

    Hoshiko->>Hoshiko: Valida usuario en VC y permisos del bot (CONNECT, SPEAK)
    Hoshiko->>Lavalink: GET /v4/loadtracks?identifier=...
    Lavalink->>Provider: Resuelve metadatos / stream URL
    Provider-->>Lavalink: Pistas resueltas (info + encoded)
    Lavalink-->>Hoshiko: LoadResult (TRACK_LOADED / SEARCH_RESULT)

    Hoshiko->>Hoshiko: Encola pista en QueueManager
    alt Reproductor no conectado al VC
        Hoshiko->>Discord: Gateway Op 4 (Voice State Update: join VC)
        Discord-->>Hoshiko: VOICE_STATE_UPDATE (session_id)
        Discord-->>Hoshiko: VOICE_SERVER_UPDATE (token, endpoint)
        Hoshiko->>Lavalink: PATCH /v4/sessions/{sid}/players/{gid} (voice credentials)
        Lavalink->>DiscordVoice: Handshake WebRTC / UDP (Opus Socket)
        DiscordVoice-->>Lavalink: Conexión establecida
    end

    Hoshiko->>Lavalink: PATCH /v4/sessions/{sid}/players/{gid} (encodedTrack, volume)
    Lavalink->>DiscordVoice: Transmisión continua de paquetes Opus (RTP/UDP)
    DiscordVoice-->>User: Audio escuchado en canal de voz

    Hoshiko->>Discord: editReply(Embed de reproducción / Now Playing)
    Lavalink-->>Hoshiko: WS Event: TrackStartEvent
    Hoshiko->>Hoshiko: Emite evento interno de inicio de pista
